### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 84/100.** Evidence Terminal-Bench 84.3%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 84/100.** Evidence HLEw tools 55.3% ; AA Index strong; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 72/100.** 204K — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 65/100.** Text in/out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 85/100.** Evidence DeepSWE 63.4% ; NL2Repo 56.3; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 75/100.** Paid $0.70/$1.40 per 1M (Z.ai).
- **Overall Score: 78/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (84+84+72+65+85)/5=78.0 → 78; best-fit per scoring methodology.

